2.8 Description of the Enterprise
The project involved rearing 60 improved Kienyeji day-old chicks under intensive management for meat production.
The birds were managed using climate-smart production technologies including:
•	Proper brooding.
•	Balanced feeding programme.
•	Vaccination.
•	Strict biosecurity.
•	Good housing.
•	Efficient waste management.
•	Rainwater harvesting.
•	Record keeping.
The birds were distributed among the five production cages to enable all student groups to participate effectively.
